                            <comment id="16332230" author="ptupitsyn" created="Fri, 19 Jan 2018 13:09:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Note: we still compile Ignite on Java 8, but should be able to run under Java 9.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16332405" author="ptupitsyn" created="Fri, 19 Jan 2018 15:33:55 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;1) JNI options can&apos;t contain spaces. Spaces should be replaced with &lt;tt&gt;=&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;
2) Java 8 fails to start with these new options. We should detect version.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
